Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:13.62,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,相信籠中安全
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:15.38,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,深信此為絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:17.72,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至忘卻創作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.87,0:02:20.51,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,那位置配不上光明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.51,0:02:22.98,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,說出希望 拋下不滿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.98,0:02:24.87,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,拉起革命的旗幟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:29.41,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,去任何人無法趕上的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:35.42,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,終有一天 超越修羅之外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:38.03,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,即使現在被壓制
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:40.90,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,使我的臥薪嘗膽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:45.50,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,也不會被奪走夢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:48.35,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,燃燒吧全身神經
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:53.09,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道向誰傳達的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.09,0:02:58.27,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有寄託意義
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:03.79,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,向著更光明
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:07.83,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,到達頂點為止
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:10.39,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,have an obsession for victory
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:13.01,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm proud of myself and you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.07,0:03:15.89,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,we must be the change we wish to see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:22.47,shokugeki_text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(300,250)\fs52.5\fn方正大黑_GBK\b0}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作 僅供日語交流之用 請勿轉載
