Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:23.81,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}騙し騙されて 失った
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:27.26,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}罵り罵られて 奪った
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:31.29,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}守りべき正義をすり減らして
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.41,0:21:34.65,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}勝ち取るものなどない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:38.32,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}籠の中から見上げた空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:41.89,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}雨上がりの青の眩しさに
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:45.32,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}囚われたままじゃ居られない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:48.81,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}昔話なら捨てて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:52.37,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}明日が言うべきは他でもない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:56.04,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}突き動かすほどの本能だ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:59.44,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}ぼくはぼくじゃなきゃ居られない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:02.66,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}変われるほど器用じゃないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.49,0:21:09.68,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}響徹雲霄的霹靂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:13.04,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}被閃光暈眩之時
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:16.69,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}絕對不要發出聲響
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:20.22,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}一動不動地忍受悄然靠近的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:23.81,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}爾虞我詐 難免失去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:27.26,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}爭吵不斷 相互奪取
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:31.29,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}本應守護的正義慢慢衰退
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.41,0:21:34.65,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}便無法贏取任何東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:38.32,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}從籠中向上仰視的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:41.89,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}被雨後的藍色所閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:45.32,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}不會就此甘願被囚禁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:48.81,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}舊事都一併丟棄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:52.37,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}明天要暢談的東西沒有別的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:56.04,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}是幾乎拉扯我前進的本能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:59.44,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}我不管什麼時候都必須是我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:02.66,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}因為我並不擅於改變
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:11.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和傳言一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:14.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,很震撼呢 中華研
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,來一個胡椒餅怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:18.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還有「玩梗的擔仔麵」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.43,0:00:21.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,悠姬 涼子 你們怎麼在這
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.72,0:00:22.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,芋煮會那邊怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:24.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我們今天輪休
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:27.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,比起這個 赤字真的沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:31.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧了新菜品「玩梗的擔仔麵」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:32.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,提升了業績
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:35.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為第一天虧損太多了 還沒有…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:36.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:38.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小幸平~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:40.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,久我前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:41.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,吃胡椒餅嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:42.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:46.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好像每天晚上偷偷摸摸在做些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:48.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然豐富了菜單
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:50.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是現在已經三天了喲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:53.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,看著你在久我飯店前生意不景氣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話我也很困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:56.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,收攤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.77,0:00:59.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快 收攤收攤收攤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.49,0:01:02.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我一生都不會忘了小幸平在這開過店
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:04.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,快 趕快收攤吧 收攤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:07.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,快滾吧 現在就滾 快快快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:08.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,收攤收攤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:10.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人怎麼這樣太讓人不爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:12.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個排隊的是什麼模擬店
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:14.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,據說是四川料理 去嚐嚐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.49,0:01:18.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊這邊 抱歉 請到最後排隊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:22.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,久我飯店 真誠感謝您的光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:23.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平這個傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.99,0:01:27.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要挑戰這個根本不可能贏的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:30.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,魯莽至極 雖然這也不是一天兩天了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:33.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天 創真說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:36.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中華研
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,「你覺得他作為飯店哪裡是滿分的地方」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:41.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:43.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:45.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,明明這麼繁盛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.07,0:01:49.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是創真君還沒有放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:25.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\fn@方正大黑_GBK\frz270\b0\c&H000000&\3c&HEFF2F2&\bord3.75\move(443.486,534.618,443.486,600.618)}選拔賽{\alpha&HFF}賽\N{\alpha&H00}進入決賽\N勝出{\alpha&HFF}出出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:25.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\fn@方正大黑_GBK\frz270\b0\c&H000000&\3c&HEFF2F2&\bord3.75\move(1090.571,520.142,1090.571,586.142)}選拔賽{\alpha&HFF}賽\N{\alpha&H00}進入決賽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:25.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\move(1534.286,541.284,1534.286,606.684)}{\fn@方正大黑_GBK\frz270\b0\c&H000000&\3c&HEFF2F2&\bord3.75}選拔賽八強
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:25.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\fn@方正大黑_GBK\frz270\b0\c&H000000&\3c&HEFF2F2&\bord3.75\move(1182.57,826.141,1182.57,892.141)}選拔賽{\alpha&HFF}賽\N{\alpha&H00}進入決賽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:25.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\fn@方正大黑_GBK\frz270\b0\c&H000000&\3c&HEFF2F2&\bord3.75\move(184,879,184,945)}選拔賽八強
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:37.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\bord0\pos(1431,330)}年輕的獅群
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:37.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎 幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:39.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,謝了 富田先生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:42.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好 安排好讓那邊幫忙籌備了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.73,0:03:45.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來 我還想在店的周圍放上好多那個
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:47.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個有點難辦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.61,0:03:50.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個我應該能幫上點忙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,創真君就繼續試做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:58.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 主將
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:00.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 有事想請你幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:10.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,創真君 好棒啊 這樣的菜單的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就用這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.51,0:04:19.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,明天是週六 到場的客人會比之前都多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:20.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,正合我意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:25.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs105\p1\fad(500,0)\blur22.5\c&H232324&\alpha&H30\fscx1029\fscy399\pos(1082.4,811.2)}m 0 0 b -7.5 1.5 -7.5 6 0 7.5 b 12 10.5 25.5 10.5 36 7.5 b 42 6 46.5 1.5 36 0 b 25.5 -3 12 -3 0 0
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:25.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(500,0)\fs82.5\pos(976.8,804)}「月饗祭」第4天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:27.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好各位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:30.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天的「中央地區」業績排行榜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:32.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我們中華研也是第一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:34.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可賀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:36.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天也要繼續努力下去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:37.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還有兩天了 司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怪人 小籠包男
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:47.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怪人 串烤仔雞肉男
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:50.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怪人 7種鮮魚刺身拼盤男
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,遠月戰隊 卡斯特羅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:55.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,邪惡的料理怪人們覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:58.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,卡斯特羅 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:04.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒啊 傳說中的料理漫畫「包丁君味郎」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:05.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,收錄了第一版的全刊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:06.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,超稀有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.61,0:05:07.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好香的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:08.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:09.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:10.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:10.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請給我一個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:11.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.73,0:05:12.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好燙燙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:13.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}好香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:14.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,美味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:15.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好辣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:16.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好辣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:17.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:22.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,久我主廚 他們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩了 富田先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是創真拜託的事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:34.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,反正堆在商店街的倉庫裡也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:38.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 和那邊的模擬店差距太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:40.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的長椅真的有用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:42.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒啦 真的非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:45.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 富田先生 作為回禮請你吃頓飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.73,0:05:48.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎 小創真的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:49.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好久沒吃到了吶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:52.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,吃飯的時候就在期待幸平飯店的味道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是膚淺 小幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:59.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,考慮了那麼久就只想到了這個？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,「如果增加位置 客人也會增多吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:04.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的想法你不覺得太單純了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:08.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,即使味道上沒辦法戰勝我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:12.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,的確我是第一次參加「月饗祭」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:15.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛入學半年的新生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:18.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是論起經營店鋪做買賣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:22.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是比前輩你早十幾年的前輩了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.39,0:06:23.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:26.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個傢伙做的是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:28.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻婆豆腐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:32.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然對久我照紀用麻婆豆腐發起正面對決嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:36.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,創真君 給
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻婆豆腐裡加面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:42.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻婆面麼 看來下了一點功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還不算是讓人耳目一新的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.41,0:06:46.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這一點衝擊力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:47.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就想和中華研競爭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:48.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是讓人笑得肚子疼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:50.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:52.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個巨大的肉丸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:56.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我說過 「用料理決勝」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:07:00.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,肉丸也不是什麼稀奇的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:02.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那種東西 滑稽也有個程度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:03.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:05.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個肉丸…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:07.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,給 富田先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:08.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我開吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:11.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 小創真 這個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:15.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,首先不破壞那個肉丸嚐嚐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:22.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平飯店的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:24.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,以前就一直吃的「麻婆豆腐」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:28.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都想吃的那種安穩的美味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:30.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和這個面相得益彰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:32.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是小創真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:33.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:41.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了 久我飯店精製的正宗麻婆豆腐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好辣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:43.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,辣死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:44.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,辣到停不下來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:46.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,對面根本無法戰勝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:48.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,料理也具有壓倒性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直是完全無懈可擊的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:52.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:56.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,讓客人完全滿足
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是那條街上十年的職業人士都頭疼的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:03.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是累了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:04.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:07.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還有多少分鐘才能進去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:10.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,客人 因為客人很多
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.31,0:08:13.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,從上菜開始20分鐘以後就需要讓出座位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:15.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,現在才剛吃完
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:19.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然想吃正宗的四川料理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:20.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是隊伍太長了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:21.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:24.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}已經等到累了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:26.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子都咕咕叫了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.41,0:08:27.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不想等了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:28.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,想趕快吃東西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:29.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,已經到極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:33.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,到今天為止我一直在觀察
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:38.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,「久我飯店」的缺點只是還沒有被發現而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:40.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,富田先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.32,0:08:43.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把肉丸完全浸在麻婆豆腐裡分成兩半
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:47.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把肉丸完全…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:09:00.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,月亮…月亮出來了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:06.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個香味 絕對不會錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:07.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.97,0:09:09.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,能讓所有人的表情都緩和下來的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,香噴噴的咖哩的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:12.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個料理是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:14.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻婆豆腐裡加咖哩？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:16.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒吃過那樣的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:17.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,月亮漸漸融化
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:19.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和麻婆豆腐混合在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:24.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,正是時候 現在是最佳品嘗時機
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:25.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請品嘗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:33.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個香味是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.79,0:09:35.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,香辛料混合著調味料
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:37.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,香味濃烈刺激 口感卻溫和醇厚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:39.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢在唇齒間回味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:41.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,香味彷彿沁入骨髓
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:45.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是小創真做的「新中華料理」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,向牛骨熬製的高湯中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:50.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,加入多種精選咖哩調料
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.41,0:09:52.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,再加入蒜蓉 生薑製成的特製咖哩汁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:55.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是那個月亮的本來面目
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.45,0:09:58.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,將咖哩汁加入明膠凝固成凍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:00.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用胡椒餅的肉餡包裹烤製
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:02.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,最後隨著肉丸破開
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:05.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,咖哩的美味一點一點在麻婆裡擴散
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:07.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是「幸平·改良版 第二部」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:09.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,「時限式·麻婆咖哩面」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個感覺好厲害的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:14.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個香味 忍不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:31.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,隊伍有一半以上都被搶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:36.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,冷靜 那個小攤位完不成這麼大的工作量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定很快就會人滿為患的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:40.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請品嘗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:43.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個肉丸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:46.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然料理方法和食材變了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.99,0:10:48.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和台灣還有中國大陸的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:51.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,做的一種砂鍋料理非常像
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:53.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這道菜的名字是「獅子頭」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:56.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,象徵繁榮昌盛的巨大肉丸子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:58.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,被比作獅子的頭部的一品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:02.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,明明應該是弱小的貓咪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:05.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在第一天大敗後經過了僅僅兩晚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:10.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就變成了勇猛的獅子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:15.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不會以為這樣就可以贏我了吧 小幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我這裡人多勢眾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:19.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你那裡只有兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:23.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼想也不會贏的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:29.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fn方正大黑_GBK\1c&H000000&\an1}繁華街區
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:32.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,極上蓋飯六人份上菜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:35.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,肉魅按照這樣下去今天…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:37.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,地區第一也不是夢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:41.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,「佛羅倫薩風味牛肚」兩份完成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:43.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,讓您久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:49.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fn方正大黑_GBK\1c&H000000&\an3}中央地區
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:51.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻婆咖哩面三份
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.43,0:11:52.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我要兩份
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:53.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.16,0:11:55.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請給我麻婆咖哩面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:58.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,兩個胡椒餅和玩梗的擔仔麵兩份
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:11:59.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要胡椒餅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.27,0:12:01.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請給我一份麻婆咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:03.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要擔仔麵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:07.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,快到極限了吧 小幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,料理速度要跟不上點菜速度了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:14.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:23.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 我想在決勝日有援軍幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:26.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像沒開模擬店 能來幫我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要進行想像訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:32.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣可以加快我的料理速度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.51,0:12:37.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在環境上儘可能地和追蹤對象相近是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:40.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把你家的廚房借給我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:42.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真有美作的作風
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:47.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩你了 那麼這個 就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:52.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平君
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:55.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請慢用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:57.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要麻婆套餐對吧 請稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:02.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字是幸平創真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:05.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要為了讓久我前輩大吃一驚而加油了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:08.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是比前輩你早十幾年的前輩了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那種地方的追蹤就不必了 快給我好好幹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那是秋季選拔賽四強的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.16,0:13:15.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,美作昴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:18.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,多一個員工而已能做得了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.01,0:13:21.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天給你的菜譜 有好好記住嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:25.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,別小看我的完美追蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:29.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我就展現想像訓練到今天為止的成果吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:31.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.61,0:13:33.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一口氣啃食掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:35.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,將「久我飯店」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:42.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻婆咖哩面十人份 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:43.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,收到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:47.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害 那個粗獷的男學生的速度和小創真完全一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:50.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.50,0:13:55.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,難以置信 彷彿有另一個幸平創真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:56.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,美味
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:57.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面有咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:13:58.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}好強烈的香氣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:13:58.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:03.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼隨便就答應下來真是非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:06.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我欠你一筆很大的人情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:08.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:12.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事 現在可不是在這裡閒聊的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.49,0:14:13.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,客人變得更多了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:18.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fn方正楷体_GBK\fs52.5\c&HB8414F&\frz348\frx10\fry10\move(503.4,885.6,496.2,412.8)}擔仔麵也有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:18.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn方正楷体_GBK\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz353.7\move(1454.4,1156.2,1459.2,966.9)}麻婆咖哩面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:15.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,胡椒餅也好像很好吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 我想吃這個
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:18.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個給我三份
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.99,0:14:20.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,田所 拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:23.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請在這邊靜坐等候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:25.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:27.74,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,勺子會使您用餐更方便嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:29.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.81,0:14:32.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,推嬰兒車的客人 可以到這邊就坐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:33.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可靠的接客
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:38.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個女孩子也不是泛泛之輩嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:40.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐姐 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:43.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:49.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在腦中分清客人們的主次需求再行動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:51.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在實地研習學到的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:52.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要全部活用上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我靈光一閃了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:56.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:59.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,靈光一閃是指什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:00.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要做一做準備
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:02.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,涼君 跟我一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:03.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:05.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 這到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:07.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,葉山君就製作咖哩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:10.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用那種和可可很配的香辛料做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:12.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？和可可？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:14.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 薙切
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:17.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,走快點 涼君
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:18.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,天色逐漸變暗了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得差不多要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:31.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,田所同學 讓你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:33.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,主將
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:35.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一口氣全部裝上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:38.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鄉土料理研究會得意的收藏品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:40.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,全國各式各樣的燈籠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:46.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:47.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:49.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,有點像那裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:51.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,台灣的九分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:54.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,變得想吃胡椒餅了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:57.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,變得這麼亮麗真是幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:00.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,明明我拒絕了鄉土研
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:03.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,的確 田所不來參加模擬店讓我感到驚訝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:06.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道你是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:11.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你不是那種毫無緣由就拋開其他事情的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:13.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,主將 非常感謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那些燈籠好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.77,0:16:15.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}好漂亮啊 好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:16.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,去那邊看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:17.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好香的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:17.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:19.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一張梅券就夠了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:21.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 要胡椒餅的請再稍等一會兒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:23.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請給我一碗玩梗的擔仔麵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:25.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好 馬上來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:26.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,五份麻婆面 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:28.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請給我三份胡椒餅
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:28.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}請給我兩份擔仔麵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:32.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 請排好隊慢等 非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.47,0:16:34.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,只有三個人工作的確是變得很費力了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:36.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如果不在此時加把勁的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:39.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,會被中華研一口氣拉開差距的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.99,0:16:42.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 沒事吧 小幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:45.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你的客人增加了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:49.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,以那種慢悠悠的節奏是贏不了我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:55.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾一下 能收拾一下桌子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:16:57.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 現在馬上去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:16:58.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,麻婆咖哩面兩份
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:00.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,胡椒餅還沒好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.41,0:17:02.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:04.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,田所的負擔太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,只能由我去烤胡椒餅了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:07.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,美作 拜託你堅持一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.43,0:17:09.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平離開爐灶的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:13.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,本來能贏也贏不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:16.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,惠專心去接客
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:17.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,胡椒餅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:19.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就交給我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:20.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,水戶同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,肉魅 蓋研呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.13,0:17:24.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我託付給後輩了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.06,0:17:28.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這個胡椒餅 我也嚐過
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:30.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不必和我說明菜譜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:36.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,烤胡椒餅的火候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.27,0:17:40.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就是不看漏表面喀哧喀哧形成的烤焦麵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:45.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,肉汁在餅內靜靜起舞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:47.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把握火候的最佳時機
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:51.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就算我閉上眼也能完美地掌握
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:56.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,新鮮出爐的胡椒餅 請慢用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:57.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝 肉魅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:17:59.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 水戶同學
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:03.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是拯救了我們商店街的組合嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:05.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,太可靠了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:07.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,強力的援軍參戰了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.05,0:18:11.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,看你好像在苦戰呢 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:13.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真讓人看不下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:16.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你苦苦哀求我的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:19.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我助你一臂之力也不是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:21.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就讓我來煮麵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:23.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:24.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 等等 伊薩米
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:26.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,聽著 幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:28.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你向久我照紀下了戰書
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:33.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不會允許你什麼都沒做到就恬不知恥地輸掉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.87,0:18:36.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好戲才正要開始呢 塔克米
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:38.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,能跟得上我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.98,0:18:39.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,廢話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:45.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,阿爾迪尼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:48.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我用完美追蹤好不容易才達到的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.81,0:18:50.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你這麼簡單就跟上了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:52.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 美作昴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:53.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,動作太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:55.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了 現在才正要開始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:56.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,看我追上你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:58.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,很難說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.11,0:19:11.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,終於 成為一家好店了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:14.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:17.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙 幸平創真
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:22.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用了四天 就在剛剛終於把那家店完成了麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:25.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,距離今天的銷售量統計還有一個小時
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:27.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,最後衝刺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:28.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,多加把勁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:33.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,多麼令人感動的場景啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是讓我太感動了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:41.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道為什麼總感覺他不是外人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:51.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,現在開始公布「中央地區」的銷售量排位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:59.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,第三名是西班牙料理研究會「El Fuego」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:01.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,第二名是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:05.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中華料理研究會的「久我飯店」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:08.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,第二名
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:14.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小幸平
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:17.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,然後第一名是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:20.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平創真的「中華攤鋪」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:22.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:23.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:25.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,創真君 太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:27.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來就沒有虧損了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.95,0:20:30.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,技巧挺不錯的嘛 美作
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.78,0:20:33.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不差 阿爾迪尼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:38.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,招待不周
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:17.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.88,0:22:21.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在這碗咖哩上面的真的是巧克力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:28.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個巧克力是用這邊的食品用3D打印機打印出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:30.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用打印機打印食物？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.39,0:22:35.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 在含有百分之八十的可可的巧克力裡摻入香辛料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:37.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,再用這些機器打印出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:39.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把這個作為咖哩的配菜的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.12,0:22:41.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就會慢慢融化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:44.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,為咖哩的風味錦上添花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.41,0:22:48.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,咖哩本身也散發著誘人的香氣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.05,0:22:49.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}爸爸 給我買那個
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.85,0:22:49.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,給我來一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:50.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}我要兩份
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.41,0:22:52.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,三份 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:51.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸也絕對想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.55,0:22:55.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,居然很受歡迎 竟然男女老少都…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.01,0:23:00.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就用這份菜品一口氣後來居上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:02.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,排位也會上升不少的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.48,0:23:04.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 會轉虧為盈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.47,0:23:09.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要客人們高興就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.27,0:23:10.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,請用
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.37,0:23:11.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我的份還沒行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:13.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 馬上來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.18,0:23:15.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}讓您久等了真是非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.18,0:23:17.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}一張梅票對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:16.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是服了你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:19.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,葉山君笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:21.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你能和朋友們好好相處
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.06,0:23:23.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,老師我很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:25.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fn方正大黑_GBK\1c&H000000&\an7}山之手地區
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.20,0:23:29.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,緋紗子 客人已經到齊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.41,0:23:30.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 薙切大人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.19,0:23:32.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:35.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天你也特意留空一張桌子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.97,0:23:37.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還是那麼好的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:46.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,以應不時之需
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.33,0:24:09.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,下集也請各位大快朵頤
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.00,0:24:10.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs105\p1\blur18\c&H232324&\alpha&H20\fscx1832\fscy579\pos(1487.429,842.314)}m 0 0 b -7.5 1.5 -7.5 6 0 7.5 b 12 10.5 25.5 10.5 36 7.5 b 42 6 46.5 1.5 36 0 b 25.5 -3 12 -3 0 0
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.00,0:24:10.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs82.5\pos(1335,819)}下集   {\fs105}陰雲籠罩的餐桌
